#: alarmmanager_admin.php:50
msgid "The administration action succeeded."
msgstr "Isenzo solawulo siphumelele."

#: alarmmanager_admin.php:86
msgid "Administration unavailable or permission denied."
msgstr "Ulawulo alufumaneki okanye imvume yaliwe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:78
msgid "Choose the alarm information to send to any service. Use Combined text to arrange device details, or Use device message to start with a complete message. Email uses Subject and Message; API destinations use the field names required by the receiving service."
msgstr "Khetha ulwazi lwesilumkiso oluza kuthunyelwa kuyo nayiphi na inkonzo. Sebenzisa umbhalo odityanisiweyo ukulungiselela iinkcukacha zesixhobo, okanye Sebenzisa umyalezo wesixhobo ukuqala ngomyalezo opheleleyo. I-imeyile isebenzisa uMbandela noMyalezo; iindawo ekujoliswe kuzo ze-API zisebenzisa amagama emimandla afunwa yinkonzo eyamkelayo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:79
msgid "Advanced message configuration"
msgstr "Uqwalaselo lomyalezo oluphucukileyo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:90
msgid "New endpoint"
msgstr "Indawo yokugqibela entsha"

#: includes/admin_view.php:100
msgid "Custom integration"
msgstr "Udibaniso lwesiko"

#: includes/admin_view.php:100
msgid "Integration provider"
msgstr "Umboneleli wodibaniso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:112
msgid "API Key SID and Secret (recommended)"
msgstr "I-API Key SID kunye neMfihlo (kuyacetyiswa)"

#: includes/admin_view.php:112
msgid "Account SID and Auth Token"
msgstr "I-Account SID kunye ne-Auth Token"

#: includes/admin_view.php:112
msgid "Twilio credentials"
msgstr "Iziqinisekiso zokungena ze-Twilio"

#: includes/admin_view.php:113
msgid "Send using"
msgstr "Thumela usebenzisa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:125
msgid "Event"
msgstr "Isiganeko"

#: includes/admin_view.php:125
msgid "Incident"
msgstr "Isiganeko esinzima"

#: includes/admin_view.php:125
msgid "ServiceNow record type"
msgstr "Uhlobo lwerekhodi ye-ServiceNow"

#: includes/admin_view.php:126
msgid "Changing the record type replaces the destination table, message fields and recovery settings with its defaults. Your instance and credentials are retained."
msgstr "Ukutshintsha uhlobo lwerekhodi kuthatha indawo yetafile yendawo ekujoliswe kuyo, imimandla yomyalezo kunye neesetingi zokuchacha ngeendawo zokungagqibekanga. Umzekelo wakho neziqinisekiso zokungena ziyagcinwa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:149
msgid "Destination"
msgstr "Indawo ekujoliswe kuyo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:154
msgid "Email settings"
msgstr "Iisetingi ze-imeyile"

#: includes/admin_view.php:161
msgid "Delivery uses the Cacti mail settings. Add the people who should receive these alarms."
msgstr "Ukuhanjiswa kusebenzisa iisetingi zemeyile ye-Cacti. Yongeza abantu ekufuneka bafumane ezi zilumkiso."

#: includes/admin_view.php:162
msgid "Script settings"
msgstr "Iisetingi zeskripthi"

#: includes/admin_view.php:167
msgid "JSON output is sent to the script on standard input."
msgstr "Iziphumo ze-JSON zithunyelwa kwiskripthi kwigalelo eliqhelekileyo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:167
msgid "The executable must exist and be executable by the worker on every delivering poller. Arguments are passed directly without a shell."
msgstr "Ifayile ephumezekayo kufuneka ibekho kwaye iphumezeke ngumsebenzi kwi-poller nganye ehambisayo. Iingxoxo zidluliswa ngqo ngaphandle kwe-shell."

#: includes/admin_view.php:169
msgid "WebSocket delivery is not implemented."
msgstr "Ukuhanjiswa kwe-WebSocket akukaphunyezwa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:171
msgid "Advanced delivery settings"
msgstr "Iisetingi zokuhambisa eziphucukileyo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:176
msgid "Connection options"
msgstr "Iinketho zoqhagamshelo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:179
msgid "Method"
msgstr "Indlela"

#: includes/admin_view.php:186
msgid "Certificate and hostname verification remain enabled. Provision the PEM file on every poller. Saved credentials are never displayed."
msgstr "Uqinisekiso lwesatifikethi negama lehosti luhlala luvuliwe. Bonelela ngefayile ye-PEM kwi-poller nganye. Iziqinisekiso zokungena ezigciniweyo azize ziboniswe."

#: includes/admin_view.php:187
msgid "Other delivery options"
msgstr "Ezinye iinketho zokuhambisa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:189 includes/admin_view.php:458
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Rhoxisa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:189
msgid "Test destination saves the current settings and queues a sample alarm for this destination. Enable the destination before testing."
msgstr "Ukuvavanya indawo ekujoliswe kuyo kugcina iisetingi zangoku kwaye kubeka isilumkiso esingumzekelo emgceni wokulinda sale ndawo. Yenza isebenze indawo ekujoliswe kuyo phambi kokuvavanya."

#: includes/admin_view.php:190
msgid "Save endpoint"
msgstr "Gcina indawo yokugqibela"

#: includes/admin_view.php:190
msgid "Test destination"
msgstr "Vavanya indawo ekujoliswe kuyo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:194
msgid "Delete endpoint"
msgstr "Cima indawo yokugqibela"

#: includes/admin_view.php:194
msgid "Delete this endpoint, its delivery settings and saved credentials"
msgstr "Cima le ndawo yokugqibela, iisetingi zayo zokuhambisa kunye neziqinisekiso zokungena ezigciniweyo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:194
msgid "Deleting stops future delivery and removes the saved settings and credentials. Remove notification rule references and resolve queued or running deliveries first. Completed and failed delivery history is preserved."
msgstr "Ukucima kumisa ukuhanjiswa kwexesha elizayo kwaye kususa iisetingi ezigciniweyo neziqinisekiso zokungena. Susa izalathiso zomgaqo wesaziso kuqala kwaye usombulule ukuhanjiswa okusemgceni wokulinda okanye okusebenzayo. Imbali yokuhanjiswa egqityiweyo nengaphumelelanga iyagcinwa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:205
msgid "Chat and messaging"
msgstr "Incoko nemiyalezo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:206
msgid "Post alarms to a Slack channel."
msgstr "Thumela izilumkiso kwitshaneli ye-Slack."

#: includes/admin_view.php:207
msgid "Post alarm cards through a Teams Workflow."
msgstr "Thumela amakhadi esilumkiso nge-Teams Workflow."

#: includes/admin_view.php:208
msgid "Send alarms from a Telegram bot."
msgstr "Thumela izilumkiso ezivela kwi-bot ye-Telegram."

#: includes/admin_view.php:209
msgid "Text alarms to phone numbers."
msgstr "Thumela izilumkiso zombhalo kwiinombolo zefowuni."

#: includes/admin_view.php:210
msgid "Send approved WhatsApp templates."
msgstr "Thumela iitempleyiti ze-WhatsApp ezivunyiweyo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:211
msgid "Incident management"
msgstr "Ulawulo lweziganeko ezinzima"

#: includes/admin_view.php:212
msgid "Trigger and resolve PagerDuty incidents."
msgstr "Vusa kwaye usombulule iziganeko ezinzima ze-PagerDuty."

#: includes/admin_view.php:213
msgid "Open and resolve ServiceNow incidents or events."
msgstr "Vula kwaye usombulule iziganeko ezinzima okanye iziganeko ze-ServiceNow."

#: includes/admin_view.php:214
msgid "Network management"
msgstr "Ulawulo lwenethiwekhi"

#: includes/admin_view.php:215
msgid "Send SNMPv2c or SNMPv3 traps and INFORMs."
msgstr "Thumela imigibe ye-SNMPv2c okanye ye-SNMPv3 kunye nee-INFORM."

#: includes/admin_view.php:216
msgid "Forward RFC 5424 or RFC 3164 messages over UDP, TCP or TLS."
msgstr "Thumela phambili imiyalezo ye-RFC 5424 okanye RFC 3164 nge-UDP, TCP okanye TLS."

#: includes/admin_view.php:217
msgid "Custom"
msgstr "Ngokwezifiso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:218
msgid "Start from an empty endpoint."
msgstr "Qala kwindawo yokugqibela engenanto."

#: includes/admin_view.php:219
msgid "POST alarm JSON to any HTTPS endpoint."
msgstr "Thumela nge-POST i-JSON yesilumkiso kuyo nayiphi na indawo yokugqibela ye-HTTPS."

#: includes/admin_view.php:220
msgid "Call an API with your own method, authentication and response checks."
msgstr "Biza i-API ngendlela yakho, uqinisekiso kunye novavanyo lweempendulo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:221
msgid "Run a local executable with the alarm as JSON input."
msgstr "Sebenzisa ifayile ephumezekayo yasekhaya enesilumkiso njengokufakwa kwe-JSON."

#: includes/admin_view.php:227
msgid "Add integration"
msgstr "Yongeza udibaniso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:228
msgid "Choose a template. It opens as a disabled draft; nothing is sent until you enable it."
msgstr "Khetha itempleyiti. Ivula njengoyilo olukhubaziweyo; akukho nto ithunyelwayo de uyenze isebenze."

#: includes/admin_view.php:228
msgid "Search integrations"
msgstr "Khangela iindibaniso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:234
msgid "Blank endpoint"
msgstr "Indawo yokugqibela engenanto"

#: includes/admin_view.php:239
msgid "No integrations match your search."
msgstr "Akukho ndibaniso zihambelana nokukhangela kwakho."

#: includes/admin_view.php:243
msgid "SNMP trap settings"
msgstr "Iisetingi zomgibe we-SNMP"

#: includes/admin_view.php:259
msgid "Saved community and passphrases are encrypted and never displayed. Leave them blank to keep the saved values; entering any value replaces all saved SNMP secrets."
msgstr "Uluntu olugciniweyo kunye namabinzana okudlula afihliwe kwaye akaze aboniswe. Shiya engenanto ukuze ugcine amaxabiso agciniweyo; ukufaka naliphi na ixabiso kuthatha indawo yazo zonke iimfihlo ze-SNMP ezigciniweyo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:260
msgid "Traps are sent as Cacti's CACTI-MIB cactiNotify with the snmptrap binary from Cacti Settings > Paths on every delivering poller. Add one destination per receiver."
msgstr "Imigibe ithunyelwa njenge-CACTI-MIB cactiNotify ye-Cacti ngefayile ye-snmptrap evela kwi-Iisetingi ze-Cacti > Imendo kwi-poller nganye ehambisayo. Yongeza indawo ekujoliswe kuyo ibe nye kumamkeli ngamnye."

#: includes/admin_view.php:261
msgid "Syslog settings"
msgstr "Iisetingi ze-Syslog"

#: includes/admin_view.php:269
msgid "TLS verifies the receiver certificate and hostname. Use port 6514 for TLS. UDP and TCP are unencrypted, and a UDP message is confirmed only as sent."
msgstr "I-TLS iqinisekisa isatifikethi somamkeli negama lehosti. Sebenzisa ichweba 6514 kwi-TLS. I-UDP ne-TCP azifihlwanga, kwaye umyalezo we-UDP uqinisekiswa kuphela njengothunyelweyo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:278 setup.php:191
msgid "Days"
msgstr "Iintsuku"

#: includes/admin_view.php:283
msgid "Timezone"
msgstr "Ummandla wexesha"

#: includes/admin_view.php:291
msgid "Times use the selected timezone and the alarm event time. An end time before the start runs overnight. Equal times cover the entire selected day."
msgstr "Amaxesha asebenzisa ummandla wexesha okhethiweyo nexesha lesiganeko sesilumkiso. Ixesha lokuphela eliphambi kokuqala lisebenza ubusuku bonke. Amaxesha alinganayo agubungela usuku lonke olukhethiweyo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:332 includes/admin_view.php:521
msgid "Create a rule"
msgstr "Yenza umgaqo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:332
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Ivuliwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:332
msgid "Priority"
msgstr "Ukubaluleka"

#: includes/admin_view.php:334
msgid "Rule and destination"
msgstr "Umgaqo nendawo ekujoliswe kuyo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:338
msgid "Alarm Destination"
msgstr "Indawo yoKuya ye-Alamu"

#: includes/admin_view.php:341
msgid "disabled"
msgstr "ikhutshiwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:343
msgid "Select one or more alarm destinations. Disabled destinations do not send alarms."
msgstr "Khetha indawo ekujoliswe kuyo yesilumkiso enye okanye ngaphezulu. Iindawo ekujoliswe kuzo ezikhubaziweyo azithumeli zilumkiso."

#: includes/admin_view.php:345
msgid "Message template"
msgstr "Itempleyiti yomyalezo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:345
msgid "Use each destination default, or customize its message for this rule. Customization starts with a copy of the destination template and does not change other rules. If several rules match the same destination, the first matching rule in priority and ID order supplies its template."
msgstr "Sebenzisa okungagqibekanga kwendawo ekujoliswe kuyo nganye, okanye lungisa umyalezo wayo ngokwezifiso kulo mgaqo. Ukulungisa ngokwezifiso kuqala ngekopi yetempleyiti yendawo ekujoliswe kuyo kwaye akutshintshi eminye imigaqo. Ukuba imigaqo emininzi ihambelana nendawo ekujoliswe kuyo enye, umgaqo wokuqala ohambelanayo ngokolandelelwano lokuphambili kunye ne-ID unikezela ngetempleyiti yawo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:352
msgid "Custom template"
msgstr "Itempleyiti yesiko"

#: includes/admin_view.php:355
msgid "Destination recipient"
msgstr "Umamkeli wendawo ekujoliswe kuyo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:355
#, php-format
msgid "Recipients: %d"
msgstr "Abamkeli: %d"

#: includes/admin_view.php:357
msgid "Customize message for this rule"
msgstr "Lungisa umyalezo walo mgaqo ngokwezifiso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:357
msgid "Unchecked: Use destination default."
msgstr "Ayikhangelwanga: Sebenzisa okungagqibekanga kwendawo ekujoliswe kuyo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:361
msgid "Optional: add each phone number in international format, such as +15551234567. These numbers replace the destination recipient for this rule. Leave the list empty to use the destination default. Each number has its own delivery status and retries."
msgstr "Ngokuzithandela: yongeza inombolo yefowuni nganye ngefomathi yamazwe ngamazwe, njengo-+15551234567. Ezi nombolo zithatha indawo yomamkeli wendawo ekujoliswe kuyo kulo mgaqo. Shiya uluhlu lungenanto ukusebenzisa okungagqibekanga kwendawo ekujoliswe kuyo. Inombolo nganye inobume bayo bokuhanjiswa kunye nokuphinda izame."

#: includes/admin_view.php:374
msgid "None"
msgstr "Akukho"

#: includes/admin_view.php:376
msgid "Build device conditions using AND, OR and groups. These conditions use the current Cacti device settings and must also satisfy any alarm filters below. With no device conditions, all devices can match."
msgstr "Yakha iimeko zesixhobo usebenzisa u-AND, OR kunye namaqela. Ezi meko zisebenzisa iisetingi zangoku zesixhobo se-Cacti kwaye kufuneka zanelise nasiphi na isihluzi sesilumkiso esingezantsi. Xa kungekho meko zesixhobo, zonke izixhobo zinokuhambelana."

#: includes/admin_view.php:376
msgid "Match devices"
msgstr "Hambelanisa izixhobo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Cacti_Admin_Notifications"
msgstr "Cacti_Admin_Notifications"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Device Status"
msgstr "Ubume Besixhobo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Syslog"
msgstr "Syslog"

#: includes/admin_view.php:387
msgid "Thold"
msgstr "Thold"

#: includes/admin_view.php:392
msgid "Build alarm conditions using AND, OR, NOT and groups. Alarms must also match the device conditions above."
msgstr "Yakha iimeko zesilumkiso usebenzisa u-AND, OR, NOT kunye namaqela. Izilumkiso kufuneka kwakhona zihambelane neemeko zesixhobo eziselapha ngasentla."

#: includes/admin_view.php:392
msgid "Match alarms"
msgstr "Hambelanisa izilumkiso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:395
msgid "No alarm sources detected yet. Sources appear after their first alarm."
msgstr "Akukho mithombo yezilumkiso ifunyenweyo okwangoku. Imithombo ivela emva kwesilumkiso sayo sokuqala."

#: includes/admin_view.php:397
msgid "By default, matching alarms can notify at any time. Turn on a schedule to limit when this rule matches."
msgstr "Ngokungagqibekanga, izilumkiso ezihambelanayo zinokwazisa nanini na. Vula ishedyuli ukuze uthintele ixesha ahambelana ngalo lo mgaqo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:397
msgid "Notification hours"
msgstr "Iiyure zesaziso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:399
msgid "Suppress notifications"
msgstr "Thintela izaziso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:399
msgid "Suppressed alarms remain in history. Recovery notifications bypass acknowledgment, cooldown and duplicate suppression, but still follow notification hours and maintenance windows."
msgstr "Izilumkiso ezithintelweyo zihlala kwimbali. Izaziso zokuchacha ziyagqitha ekuvunyeni, kwixesha lokupholisa nakuthintelo lweekopi eziphindaphindiweyo, kodwa zisalandela iiyure zesaziso neefestile zokulungisa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:403
msgid "Set a duration to 0 to turn it off."
msgstr "Misela ixesha libe ngu-0 ukuze uyicime."

#: includes/admin_view.php:405
msgid "Rule order"
msgstr "Ulandelelwano lwemigaqo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:408
msgid "Create rule"
msgstr "Yenza umgaqo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:408
msgid "Rules with equal priority run in ID order. Stopping also applies when this rule suppresses notifications."
msgstr "Imigaqo enokuphambili okulinganayo isebenza ngokolandelelwano lwe-ID. Ukuma kusebenza naxa lo mgaqo uthintela izaziso."

#: includes/admin_view.php:417
msgid "Configuration Backup/Restore"
msgstr "Ugcino-khopi/Ukubuyisela uQwalaselo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:427
msgid "Paused"
msgstr "Inqunyanyisiwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:427
msgid "Running"
msgstr "Iyasebenza"

#: includes/admin_view.php:428
msgid "everything has been delivered"
msgstr "yonke into ihanjisiwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:428
#, php-format
msgid "oldest queued %s UTC"
msgstr "eyona indala emgceni wokulinda %s UTC"

#: includes/admin_view.php:428
msgid "waiting messages"
msgstr "imiyalezo elindileyo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:431
msgid "Hide messages"
msgstr "Fihla imiyalezo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:431
msgid "View messages"
msgstr "Jonga imiyalezo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "Indawo yokuGqibela"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ID"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Message"
msgstr "Umyalezo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Next try"
msgstr "Umzamo olandelayo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441 includes/reports.php:458
msgid "Queued"
msgstr "Isemgceni wokulinda"

#: includes/admin_view.php:441
msgid "Tries"
msgstr "Imizamo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:451
msgid "Times in UTC · first 100 shown"
msgstr "Amaxesha kwi-UTC · ezokuqala ezili-100 zibonisiwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:455
msgid "Pause delivery"
msgstr "Nqumamisa ukuhanjiswa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:455
msgid "Resume delivery"
msgstr "Qhubeka nokuhambisa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:458
msgid "Clear queue"
msgstr "Coca umgca wokulinda"

#: includes/admin_view.php:459
#, php-format
msgid "Discard all %d waiting notifications on this poller?"
msgstr "Lahla zonke izaziso ezilindileyo eziyi-%d kule poller?"

#: includes/admin_view.php:460
msgid "Includes retries. They stay in delivery history as failed, reason queue_cleared."
msgstr "Kubandakanya ukuphinda uzame. Zihlala kwimbali yokuhanjiswa njengezingaphumelelanga, isizathu queue_cleared."

#: includes/admin_view.php:461
msgid "Messages already sending and alarm state are kept."
msgstr "Imiyalezo esele ithunyelwa kunye nobume besilumkiso ziyagcinwa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:462
msgid "Tip: pause delivery first during maintenance."
msgstr "Icebiso: nqumamisa ukuhanjiswa kuqala ngexesha lokulungisa."

#: includes/admin_view.php:463
msgid "Clear queue…"
msgstr "Coca umgca wokulinda…"

#: includes/admin_view.php:464
msgid "Controls apply to this poller. While paused, alarms are still received and queued; Resume sends them."
msgstr "Ulawulo lusebenza kule poller. Ngelixa inqunyanyisiwe, izilumkiso zisafunyanwa zize zibekwe emgceni wokulinda; uQhubeka uyazithumela."

#: includes/admin_view.php:467
msgid "View delivery results"
msgstr "Jonga iziphumo zokuhambisa"

#: includes/admin_view.php:470
msgid "Create an integration, configure its destination and credentials, test a sample alarm here, then select it directly in a rule."
msgstr "Yenza udibaniso, qwalasela indawo ekujoliswe kuyo neziqinisekiso zayo, vavanya isilumkiso esingumzekelo apha, emva koko usikhethe ngqo kumgaqo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:476
msgid "Configured integrations"
msgstr "Iindibaniso eziqwalaselweyo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:479
msgid "No integrations yet. Choose a template above to create one."
msgstr "Akukho ndibaniso okwangoku. Khetha itempleyiti engasentla ukwenza enye."

#: includes/admin_view.php:490
msgid "Alarm Rules"
msgstr "Imigaqo yeZilumkiso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:490
msgid "Choose which alarms should notify, where to send them and when to pause notifications. Rules run from lowest to highest priority."
msgstr "Khetha ukuba zeziphi izilumkiso ekufuneka zazise, zithunyelwe phi kwaye zinqunyanyiswe nini izaziso. Imigaqo isebenza ukusuka kweyona iphantsi ukuya kweyona iphezulu."

#: includes/admin_view.php:493
msgid "Create an integration before saving your first rule."
msgstr "Yenza udibaniso phambi kokugcina umgaqo wakho wokuqala."

#: includes/admin_view.php:493
msgid "Create integration"
msgstr "Yenza udibaniso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Sula"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Critical"
msgstr "Kubucayi"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Information"
msgstr "Ulwazi"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Major"
msgstr "Enkulu"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Minor"
msgstr "Encinci"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Occurrence"
msgstr "Ukwenzeka"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Raised"
msgstr "Iphakanyisiwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Recovered"
msgstr "Ichachile"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Reminder"
msgstr "Isikhumbuzo"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Updated"
msgstr "Ihlaziyiwe"

#: includes/admin_view.php:495
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Isilumkiso"

#: includes/admin_view.php:520
msgid "Alarm notifications require an enabled matching Alarm Rule. Without one, alarms remain in history but no notifications are sent."
msgstr "Izaziso zezilumkiso zifuna uMgaqo weSilumkiso ohambelanayo ovuliweyo. Ngaphandle kwawo, izilumkiso zihlala kwimbali kodwa akukho zaziso zithunyelwayo."

#: includes/admin_view.php:524
msgid "No rules yet. Create a rule below to start routing alarms to your notification destinations."
msgstr "Akukho migaqo okwangoku. Yenza umgaqo ngezantsi ukuze uqale ukuthumela izilumkiso kwiindawo ekujoliswe kuzo zezaziso."

#: includes/admin_view.php:533
